OL,3,APaddy Power cuts 1,400 jobs and blames
OL,4,Abetting tax rises
OL,5,
OL,6,FPaddy Power-owner Flutter has announced
OL,7,Fplans to cut up to 1,400 jobs as its
OL,8,Fboss claimed the company "cannot fully
OL,9,Fabsorb" tax rises imposed on the
OL,10,Fgambling industry.
OL,12,FStaff based in Leeds and across the UK
OL,13,Fand Ireland, as well as British and
OL,14,FIrish workers at Flutter's Portugal and
OL,15,FRomania sites will be affected, but
OL,16,Fwhat roles are at risk has not been
OL,17,Fdisclosed.
OL,19,FThe government announced taxes rises on
OL,20,Fonline casino and sports betting, with
OL,21,Fan exemption for horse racing, in the
OL,22,FBudget last year.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
